        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "`let` declares an immutable constant; `var` declares a mutable variable"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "`var` is global; `let` is local"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "There is no difference"
        }
